     6120          ( ACCUM TOTAL  by d-slt-vat.vat-pc d-slt-vat.uchet-sum )   CHR(9)
     6121          ( ACCUM TOTAL  by d-slt-vat.vat-pc d-slt-vat.VAT-r-b )    CHR(9)
