     6123          (ACCUM TOTAL  by d-slt-vat.vat-pc d-slt-vat.n-u-sum) / (ACCUM TOTAL  by d-slt-vat.vat-pc d-slt-vat.slt-r-b-brutto)  * 100
     6124          skip.
